*.sym

# ...except the 2.11BSD conformance blocks.  These are not build output: they are
# three 1 KB blocks lifted off a live PDP-11/70's root filesystem and are the
# only foreign-volume evidence the UFS campaign has.  Losing them means fgxfs is
# back to agreeing with itself.
!tools/testdata/211bsd/*.bin

